      "sentence": "Nenu annam ___ .",
      "correct": "tintanu",
      "acceptedVariants": [
        "tintanu"
      ],
      "explanation": "'Nenu annam tintanu' means 'I eat rice'. The verb 'tinuta' conjugates to 'tintanu' for 'I eat'."
    },
    {
